    <div class="pdT" style="background: #000000; color:#ffffff;">
      <div class="richTitle">Product Show</div>
      <img data-src="/image/catalog/development-board/Core11061408/Core11061408-details-15.jpg" alt="Luckfox Core1106 Core Board, product show" / class="lazyload">
    </div>
    <div class="pdT" style="background: #000000; color:#ffffff;">
      <div class="richTitle">Development Resources</div>
      <p class="richDesc">Complete software and hardware resources and an active community help secondary development</p>
      <img data-src="/image/catalog/development-board/Core11061408/Core11061408-details-11.jpg" alt="Luckfox Core1106 Core Board, provides complete software and hardware documentation" / class="lazyload">
    </div>
    <div class="pdT" style="background: #000;">
      <div class="richTitle" style="color:#ffffff;">What's On Board</div>
      <img data-src="/image/catalog/development-board/Core11061408/Core11061408-details-intro.jpg" alt="Luckfox Core1106 Core Board, onboard components" / class="lazyload">
      <div class="bgWhite round1234" style="background: #000000;">
        <div class="alignl bgGrey round1234">
          <div class="richGridWrap richGridWrap-valignTop richGridWrap-2c alignl subBlock">
            <div>
              <ol>
                <li><strong> RV1106G2 / RV1106G3 </strong> <br> Vision processor SoC with built-in ARM Cortex-A7 core</li>
                <li><strong> PMIC </strong> <br> 3-ch power management chip</li>
                <li><strong> 8GB eMMC </strong> <br> for Core1106xx08 versions only</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
            <div>
              <ol start="4">
                <li><strong> 256MB SPI NAND </strong> <br> for Core1106xxN256 versions only</li>
                <li><strong> Wi-Fi 6 / Bluetooth module </strong> <br> 2.4G Wi-Fi 6; BT5.2/BLE Bluetooth module (for wireless version only)</li>
                <li><strong> Antenna connector </strong> <br> IPEX 1.0 connector (for wireless version only)</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pdT" style="background: #000; color: #fff;">
      <div class="richTitle">Parameter comparison</div>
      <div class="pdTRBL">
      <table class="tabSty-2 mgnTB alignl" style="color: #fff;">
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> CPU </strong></td>
            <td>Options for RV1106G2 (0.5TOPS, 128MB DDR3L) or RV1106G3 (1TOPS, 256MB DDR3L)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Processor </strong></td>
            <td>Cortex A7 at 1.2GHz</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> ISP </strong></td>
            <td>Supports 5M at 30fps input</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Video encoding </strong></td>
            <td>Hardware encoding, supports MJPEG, H264, H265</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Display interface </strong></td>
            <td>Parallel RGB 18-bit × 1</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Camera interface </strong></td>
            <td>MIPI CSI 2-lane × 2 or MIPI CSI 4-lane × 1</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Microphone </strong></td>
            <td>Analog differential MIC interface × 2</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Audio output </strong></td>
            <td>LINEOUT × 1</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> USB </strong></td>
            <td>USB 2.0 Host/Device</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> wireless module </strong></td>
            <td>Options for 2.4GHz Wi-Fi 6 / Bluetooth 5.2 / BLE</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Ethernet port </strong></td>
            <td>10/100M Ethernet controller and embedded PHY</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Default storage </strong></td>
            <td>Options for eMMC (8GB) or SPI NAND (256MB)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Other resources </strong></td>
            <td>I2S × 3, I2C × 5, SPI × 2, SDIO × 2, ADC × 2, UART × 6, PWM × 12</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Dimensions </strong></td>
            <td>30 × 30 (mm)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;"><strong> Castellated holes </strong></td>
            <td>112 Pin</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
      <p class="note">* Some pin resources are multiplexed, please refer to wiki for detailed pin definitions.</p>
      <br>
    </div>
